0.06 0.09 0.16 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 30.0 600.0 Td (Cada isolado i e representado por x_i = [x_{i,F1} || x_{i,F2} || Phi_dobra\(x_{i,F3}\)], sem metadados geograficos/ano:) Tj ET
0.06 0.09 0.16 rg BT /F1 8 Tf 30.0 580.0 Td (  * F1 \(Genes AMR adquiridos\): presenca binaria via AMRFinderPlus/CARD \(blaCTX-M-15, aac\(3\)-IIa, armA, qnrS1, mecA\).) Tj ET
